#{[17592186342052 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186341443 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342052 #edb/ref 1069 "q-73656" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342052 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342052 #edb/ref 1071 "What is the value of ${\\int }_{8}^{64}\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{{log}_{8}⁡x}}\\,\\text{d}x?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342052 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "3ddbff7e-d3cb-563f-8731-6916af8ccc56" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342052 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $u={log}_{8}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡8}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡8\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $8$ | $64$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{8}^{64}\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{{log}_{8}⁡x}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{8}^{64}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{log}_{8}⁡x}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡8\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡8{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡8(2\\sqrt{u}){|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡8(\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{1}) \\\\  & =2(\\sqrt{2}-1)\\operatorname{ln}⁡8\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384656 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186384657 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384656 #edb/ref 1069 "q-210751" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384656 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384656 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\int \\frac{{log}_{5}⁡({x}^{3})}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384656 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "6517d214-0493-5c34-bfbe-5920e35412fd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384656 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $u={log}_{5}⁡({x}^{3}).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{3}\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{5}⁡({x}^{3})}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int {log}_{5}⁡({x}^{3})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int u\\cdot (\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{3}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{6}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{6}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5{log}_{5}^{2}⁡({x}^{3})}{12}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384657 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186384658 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384657 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186384659 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384657 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186384660 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384657 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186384661 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384657 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186384662 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384657 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384657 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384657 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186384660 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384657 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "c996e19a-d711-54dc-9b49-a03cea7cecd2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384658 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{{log}_{5}^{2}⁡({x}^{3})}{6}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384658 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384658 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "126fc08e-95cb-5306-9924-3f019148d8ef" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384659 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{3})}{12}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384659 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384659 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c5ca6758-4100-5c28-a5e2-8d3c88248263" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384660 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5{log}_{5}^{2}⁡({x}^{3})}{12}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186384660 #e